{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：港交所二季度核心收入增长强劲，研究收益超预期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">港交所<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报最值得看的判断，不是净利润增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>这个结果，而是收入结构里核心业务与回报表现的此消彼长。MS在8月19日发布的业绩点评中给出明确信号：交易及结算费用分别同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>，而净回报表现同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，占总收入比重从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>。核心业务的增长质量，比总量数字更说明问题。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告覆盖的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>数据。港交所当季总收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">84.99亿</span>港元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，比MS预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，比市场一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>。净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">53.8亿</span>港元，同比增长21%。超预期部分主要来自上市费和净回报表现两项，前者因 forfeitures 数量增加而走高，后者则靠非上市股权研究的估值收益拉动。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVYibkABSbvdEibiaia8bOsM84xcSVNXYibhfR7INjrunTzuxx1z1KDIplQibE2DLNyicOsc1ZaxzPN4q898s60FqeeFdgvrGEApKCM1c/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 北向交易日均成交额同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">141%</span>，成为交易费增长的主要引擎</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看成交数据。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>港交所日均成交额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2900亿</span>港元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。其中北向交易日均成交额同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">141%</span>，这个增速远超整体水平，直接支撑了交易费和结算费的快速增长。衍生品日均成交额同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，主要由期权驱动；商品日均成交额也上升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把数字拆开看，北向交易的高增长意味着内地资金通过相关市场通参与香港市场的活跃度在明显提升。交易费和结算费分别增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>，与北向成交的放量节奏基本同步。这里更值得关注的是，衍生品和商品成交的增速虽然不如现货突出，但也在同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，说明市场参与度不是单一渠道的脉冲式上升。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看北向日均成交额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">141%</span>的同比增速，它比整体ADV的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>高出太多，说明增量资金主要来自内地渠道。简单说，相关市场通机制下的资金流动已经成为港交所交易费收入的核心变量；后续更值得观察的是这种北向活跃度能否维持，而不是单季度的同比数字。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUbEHA9Z9cib0cPrU7cypDicicmeicicBOH9zrqABcep7Ik52WucQmyVMLHeOZYLvfHGB5adsXC37JW1ts2PpkawQCLPmFTLmQJv8qY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 净回报表现<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>靠一次性估值收益，核心收入占比反而在提升</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">净回报表现<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.79亿</span>港元，环比持平，但比MS预期高出约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的主要原因是非上市股权研究的估值收益，上半年合计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.98亿</span>港元，其中<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>占<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.9亿</span>港元。不过由于去年同期基数较高，净回报表现同比仍下降17%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有个容易被忽略的结构变化。净回报表现占总收入比重从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，不是因为回报表现大幅缩水，而是核心收入增长更快，分母变大了。报告认为这是正面信号，说明收入质量在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，对研究端波动的依赖在降低。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 净回报表现<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>听起来是好事，但拆开看，主要来自非上市股权研究的估值重估，属于非经常性项目。我的理解是，市场不应把这一块当作可持续的盈利来源；更值得跟踪的是剔除估值收益后，核心业务收入能否继续支撑利润增长。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX2DLvbLxhev5MtrOFIBjmXnfS9U6m0arDOToicGRMjGWh0bV6KPakYfETOdWs1tO3xtkAnyXtffcPZXOtGNwmniakbuia8X8efP0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 上市费同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24%</span>，但环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，IPO转化节奏仍需观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上市费<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.04亿</span>港元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24%</span>，比MS预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，也比市场一致预期高。增长原因报告写得很直接：forfeitures 数量增加。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 83-MS-HK Exchanges - Clearing-0388.HK-Solid core revenue growth in 2Q26- investment income also beating expectations-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
